      "content": "Our cold storage unit on the refrigerated truck heading to the Toyosu market just triggered a high-temp alarm. The sensors show it's been sitting at 12C for the last two hours instead of the required -2C. What are the immediate steps we need to take regarding the shipment integrity and safety protocols?",
